{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7c43fc54532032fd26604cedcb3462ae79a4fe5500c314eeb36a589004b39172","ja":"あったかいお茶を淹れてきたよぉ。\nレッスン、お疲れさまだべさ。","zh":"我泡了热茶过来哦。\n练习辛苦啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"df250ee416a4b1171f975eae1b6634f76f549bbce0e4905fb0439289ea745a08","ja":"わぁ、ひなたちゃんありがとう！\nスノーボールクッキーも、よかったら食べてね。","zh":"哇，谢谢日向！\n雪球饼干如果合心意的话，也请尝尝吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"73757e1157e70b8eccccfa6003e2f74aa28b8ccead6b4e54a169940a7cddc0d9","ja":"ありがとうございます。\n今日みたいな雪の日に、ぴったりのお菓子ですね♪","zh":"谢谢你。\n这正是最适合像今天这样的下雪天的点心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f48eed6e85d01d20bcf0dd2eb50f8b989d91fdde8b0b0a23b86b02bfc44702d9","ja":"めんこい形だねぇ。\nそういえば、外は大丈夫だろか？","zh":"样子挺可爱的呢。\n说起来，外面不要紧吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1d49560a20f793e5cc6213c11a4f17cb16f36929b72b1d27164fdfced1761051","ja":"予報だと、今日はもう降らないみたい。\n帰るのは問題ないんじゃないかな？","zh":"天气预报说今天好像不会再下了。\n回去应该没问题吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a5ac11942a51d40f22538e260dccb29f8941d65457fa9a26865f28ff930dd7cd","ja":"そうなんだ？　どれくらい積もったのかな……？","zh":"这样啊？不知道积了多少雪呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"57fd09392ff45e8aa30752c9758d9390a2dfff332f8d2cdbfcfb77b234f3951a","ja":"すごい、一面の雪景色だよ！\nせっかくだし、SNSにあげておこっと♪","zh":"好厉害，放眼望去全都是雪景呢！\n难得遇到，发到社交平台上去吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f2396b2b549469ec97f2e17cda6b48c02c6e1f4008b22a645ae37dc67f1c4639","ja":"…………ピコン……ピコン。\nピコン、ピコン、ピコン！","zh":"…………哔咚……哔咚。\n哔咚、哔咚、哔咚！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"765e86c0ce70e079d7f8777ee81f4cb0d2b0713da51db5bcff46d02448a810a0","ja":"わぁ～。いっぱい鳴ってるねぇ。","zh":"哇～，响个不停呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"50f99a3e38a8bad62f45da60a47f375765563cbab1c198efd195e03486a1c0aa","ja":"ファンのみなさん、\nすごく反応してくれてますね。","zh":"粉丝们\n反响非常热烈呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"bfcfe37b3d5f6f291853696b5c58ca41b784660a70428f2f3a41fc972f43efc0","ja":"最近SNSの更新がちょっと少なかったから、\nみんな待っててくれたのかな？","zh":"最近SNS更新得有点少，\n大家是不是都在等我呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6f0b423d708713f3901bbd10c48608aa1e504c58fa3966308371b158be63202c","ja":"そういえば、年末でバタバタしていたので、\n私もあまり更新していませんでした……。","zh":"说起来，年末忙得不可开交，\n我也没有怎么更新……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"3a1e99c6a42b25e442ec4171b2ffcde05c19c1a1c1d14c6e9748e1eedb3ecafb","ja":"待っててくれてるみんなのために、\nあたしも何かあげようかなぁ。","zh":"为了等着我的大家，\n我也送点什么好呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"7682d8d8c98f863cbe1438cb9f8b7ef8a7fd5e95b644fc01d0a81904f47c771a","ja":"それなら、今から雪で何か作ってみない？\nその写真をSNSにあげてみるのはどうかな♪","zh":"要是这样的话，要不要现在就用雪做点什么呢？\n把照片发到社交平台上去看看怎么样♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"a085aa4c978f26aabecd2b12ad39fd1ce3cc3c2572d34b4107c2bcceb99ec5fa","ja":"それは楽しそうだねぇ。\n何を作ろうか♪","zh":"那听起来很有意思呢。\n要做些什么好呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1690.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"2b855c24abeba0dc10848146a633a8a7af6ce53b06821d10efa725bee7ac911f","ja":"ふふ。せっかくなら3人それぞれで違うものを作って\nSNSにあげるまで秘密、というのはどうですか？","zh":"呵呵。难得有机会，不如我们3个人各自做不一样的东西，\n在发到社交平台之前互相保密，大家觉得怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
